iv class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">The 3rd Biennial Conference of the Comparative Education Society of Cambodia: Deschooling for Post-COVID-19 Recovery<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">25-26 May 2023, CamTech Campus, Phnom Penh, Cambodia<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Deadline for submissions: February 17, 2023<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Please scan the QR code for the abstract template and submission<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Comparative Education Society of Cambodia (CESCam) was established in 2018 by a group of researchers from the Cambodia Development Resource Institute (CDRI) and scholars from some Cambodian universities. It was inaugurated during the 11th Biennial Conference of the Comparative Education Society of Asia. Over the years, our members and network have expanded locally and globally.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">With a vision to promote comparative education for higher learning in Cambodia, CESCam intends to foster teaching and research in the area of comparative education in Cambodia, produce publications about Cambodian education and beyond, contribute to advancing philosophy, methodology, and methods in comparative education in Cambodia, and establish networks with local and international research and educational institutions and other counterpart societies. We now kindly invite submissions of research contributions on education towards sustainable development.<\/div><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7e09bcd2 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"7e09bcd2\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-1558759\" data-id=\"1558759\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-69e32e75 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer\" data-id=\"69e32e75\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"spacer.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-spacer-inner\"><\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-61204511 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"61204511\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-e